  <content>
    <section>
      <title>Activity</title>
      <para>Thinking back to the last activity, you learned about the \(r\)-value. Write these characteristics about the \(r\)-value.</para>
      <para>The \(r\)-value is called a correlation coefficient. A <term class="glossary-tooltip">correlation coefficient</term> is one way to measure the strength of a linear relationship.
</para>
      <list>
        <item>The sign of \(r\) is the same as the sign of the slope of the best fit line.</item>
        <item>The values for \(r\) go from –1 to 1 and include –1 and 1.</item>
        <item>The closer \(r\) is to 1 or –1, the stronger the linear relationship between the variables.</item>
        <item>The closer \(r\) is to 0, the weaker the linear relationship between the variables.</item>
      </list>
      <para>Take turns with your partner to match a scatter plot with a correlation coefficient. For each match you find, explain to your partner how you know it’s a match. For each match your partner finds, listen carefully to their explanation. If you disagree, discuss your thinking and work to reach an agreement.</para>
      <para>A <figure><media alt="Graph of a scatter plot, xy-plane, origin O.  "><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_03_06_09_01.svg"/></media></figure><figure><media alt="Graph of a scatter plot, xy-plane, origin O.   "><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_03_06_09_02.svg"/></media></figure><figure><media alt="Graph of a scatter plot, xy-plane, origin O.   "><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_03_06_09_03.svg"/></media></figure><figure><media alt="Graph of a scatter plot, xy-plane, origin O.   "><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_03_06_09_04.svg"/></media></figure><figure><media alt="Graph of a scatter plot, xy-plane, origin O. "><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_03_06_09_05.svg"/></media></figure><figure><media alt="Graph of a scatter plot, xy-plane, origin O."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_03_06_09_06.svg"/></media></figure><figure><media alt="Graph of a scatter plot, xy-plane, origin O."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_03_06_09_07.svg"/></media></figure><figure><media alt="Graph of a scatter plot, xy-plane, origin O."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_03_06_09_08.svg"/></media></figure></para>
